WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.957
Unit sixteen. Using Medicine Safely!

2
00:00:04.907 --> 00:00:08.488
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.538 --> 00:00:12.419
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.469 --> 00:00:16.654
Today we learn about Using Medicine Safely. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:20.940
Medicine. Say it with me. Medicine!

6
00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:27.757
Dose. Say it with me. Dose!

7
00:00:31.254 --> 00:00:34.521
Label. Say it with me. Label!

8
00:00:38.021 --> 00:00:42.104
Pharmacist. Say it with me. Pharmacist!

9
00:00:45.623 --> 00:00:49.523
Side effect. Say it with me. Side effect!

10
00:00:53.016 --> 00:00:57.349
Antibiotics. Say it with me. Antibiotics!

11
00:01:00.838 --> 00:01:03.988
Share. Say it with me. Share!

12
00:01:07.472 --> 00:01:11.939
Expiry date. Say it with me. Expiry date!

13
00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:26.700
Medicine must be taken at the right dose as shown on the label or by a pharmacist. Never share prescription medicine. Check the expiry date and report any side effect.

14
00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:28.171
I can do that too!

15
00:01:29.832 --> 00:01:35.181
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:35.231 --> 00:01:36.381
Label!

17
00:01:37.232 --> 00:01:42.407
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:42.457 --> 00:01:43.607
Share!

19
00:01:44.355 --> 00:01:49.628
Did you know? Using antibiotics wrongly can help bacteria become resistant to them!

20
00:01:49.678 --> 00:01:51.797
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:53.254 --> 00:02:02.202
Think and answer. Why should you finish antibiotics as your doctor tells you?

22
00:02:02.252 --> 00:02:03.402
Great answer!

23
00:02:04.452 --> 00:02:09.409
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:09.459 --> 00:02:12.076
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

